<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h2 class="pa-card__title-text">File Upload — Web Dropzone Component</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Accessible file-upload web component from <code>@keenmate/web-dropzone</code> with drag-and-drop,
      file previews, validation, upload-progress tracking, and multiple display modes. Framework-agnostic,
      form-associated, and themed via CSS custom properties — it inherits the active Pure Admin theme through
      the shared <code>--base-*</code> variables, the same bridge <code>&lt;web-multiselect&gt;</code> uses.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Three orthogonal display axes</strong> combine freely:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><code>selector-appearance</code> — <strong>card</strong> · button · minimal · native <em>(what the user clicks / drops onto)</em></li>
      <li><code>list-appearance</code> — <strong>list</strong> · detailed · grid · badges · popover · none <em>(where picked files appear)</em></li>
      <li><code>card-size</code> — minimal · <strong>compact</strong> · big <em>(density of the card selector)</em></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="pa-text-muted">
      Uploads on this page are <strong>simulated</strong> (a local progress stub) so you can watch the
      progress UI without a server. Files that fail <code>accept</code> / size / count rules surface as toasts.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SELECTOR APPEARANCE -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Selector Appearance <code>(selector-appearance)</code></h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>Four visual entry points for picking files.</p>
    <div class="pa-row">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>card (default) — bordered drop zone</label>
          <web-dropzone selector-appearance="card" list-appearance="list" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Click anywhere on the card to browse, or drag-and-drop files.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>button — accent button, no drag zone</label>
          <web-dropzone selector-appearance="button" list-appearance="list" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Use when the picker should sit inline (toolbars, dense forms).</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>minimal — icon-only with count badge</label>
          <web-dropzone selector-appearance="minimal" list-appearance="list" accept="*/*" icon="📎" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Compact button; the badge appears when files are picked.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>native — button + text label, like <code>&lt;input type="file"&gt;</code></label>
          <web-dropzone selector-appearance="native" list-appearance="none" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5" select-files-text="Choose Files"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Empty: "No file chosen" · 1 file: filename · multiple: "N files chosen". Customize via <code>select-files-text</code> / <code>no-file-chosen-text</code>.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- LIST APPEARANCE -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">List Appearance <code>(list-appearance)</code></h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>How the picked files are presented — from a simple vertical list to badge pills or a hidden popover.</p>
    <div class="pa-row">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>list (default) — simple rows</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="list" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>detailed — icon + size + MIME</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="detailed" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>grid — image preview thumbnails</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="grid" accept="image/*" max-file-count="6" prompt-text="Drop images"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>badges — inline composite pills</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="badges" accept="*/*" max-file-count="6" prompt-text="Drop files (badges appear inline)"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Same badge surface as <code>web-multiselect</code>. Add <code>show-thumbnails</code> for image previews.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>badges + <code>show-thumbnails</code></label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="badges" show-thumbnails accept="image/*" max-file-count="6" prompt-text="Drop images for badge thumbnails"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>popover — list hidden, click summary to open</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="popover" accept="image/*,.pdf" max-file-size="5MB" max-file-count="10"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Popover header shows count + Add more / Clear all; footer pins total size.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-row" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>none — list not rendered (caller handles it)</label>
          <web-dropzone id="list-none" list-appearance="none" accept="*/*" max-file-count="5"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Picked: <span id="list-none-out">(none)</span></small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label><code>max-visible-files="3"</code> — caps rows, "Show N more" reveals the rest</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="detailed" max-visible-files="3" accept="*/*" max-file-count="20"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-1-3">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label><code>--dz-file-list-max-height</code> — CSS height cap + internal scroll</label>
          <web-dropzone list-appearance="detailed" accept="*/*" max-file-count="20" style="--dz-file-list-max-height: 18rem;"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

