<!-- SATELLITE ARCHITECTURE -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Satellite Elements <code>(for="&lt;store-id&gt;")</code></h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      The store and its surfaces can be split into standalone elements that bind to a store by id via
      <code>for=""</code>. Here one <code>&lt;web-dropzone controls="picker"&gt;</code> acts as the store +
      picker, and the list, overall-progress strip, and floating status indicator are rendered by separate
      satellites — anywhere on the page.
    </p>
    <div class="pa-row">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Store + picker only</label>
          <web-dropzone id="sat-store" controls="picker" accept="*/*" multiple max-file-count="10" prompt-text="Drop files — surfaces render on the right"></web-dropzone>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label><code>&lt;web-dropzone-progress&gt;</code> — overall strip</label>
          <web-dropzone-progress for="sat-store"></web-dropzone-progress>
        </div>
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label><code>&lt;web-dropzone-list&gt;</code> — detailed list satellite</label>
          <web-dropzone-list for="sat-store" list-appearance="detailed"></web-dropzone-list>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="pa-text-muted">
      A <code>&lt;web-dropzone-indicator for="sat-store"&gt;</code> (floating status chip + slide-out drawer)
      is also mounted for this store — it appears once an upload is active.
    </p>
    <web-dropzone-indicator for="sat-store"></web-dropzone-indicator>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- COMPOSABLE CONTROLS -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Composable Controls <code>(controls + item-controls)</code></h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>
      Two allowlists. <code>controls</code> picks which top-level <strong>surfaces</strong> render;
      <code>item-controls</code> picks which <strong>parts of each file row</strong> render. Both are
      comma-separated; an absent attribute means "render all". Toggle the boxes and add a file to watch it recompose.
    </p>
    <div class="pa-row">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <web-dropzone id="controls-demo"
            selector-appearance="card"
            list-appearance="detailed"
            accept="*/*"
            multiple
            max-file-count="8"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">Live: <code id="controls-demo-attrs"></code></small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <fieldset style="border: 1px solid var(--pa-border-color); border-radius: var(--pa-border-radius); padding: 0.5rem 1rem 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 1rem;">
          <legend style="font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 0 0.4rem;"><code>controls</code> — surfaces</legend>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-ctrl="picker" checked> picker</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-ctrl="list" checked> list</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-ctrl="overall-progress" checked> overall-progress</label>
        </fieldset>
        <fieldset style="border: 1px solid var(--pa-border-color); border-radius: var(--pa-border-radius); padding: 0.5rem 1rem 0.85rem; margin: 0;">
          <legend style="font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 0 0.4rem;"><code>item-controls</code> — row parts</legend>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="icon" checked> icon</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="name" checked> name</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="size" checked> size</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="type" checked> type</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="progress" checked> progress</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="status" checked> status</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="action" checked> action</label>
          <label class="pa-checkbox-inline"><input type="checkbox" data-item="remove" checked> remove</label>
        </fieldset>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- RECIPES -->
<div class="pa-card">
  <div class="pa-card__header">
    <div class="pa-card__title">
        <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Recipes — progress rules in userland</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pa-card__body">
    <p>Count- or state-based progress behaviour needs no dedicated attributes — compose it from the primitives above plus the <code>change</code> event and <code>auto-upload</code>.</p>
    <div class="pa-row">
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Per-row bars only at 4+ files <em>(count-based)</em></label>
          <web-dropzone id="recipe-count" list-appearance="detailed" accept="*/*" multiple max-file-count="8"></web-dropzone>
          <small class="pa-form-text">1–3 files → global strip only. 4+ → both bars. Only the per-row <code>progress</code> token toggles.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pa-col-100 pa-col-md-50">
        <div class="pa-form-group">
          <label>Global strip only after upload starts <em>(state-based)</em></label>
          <web-dropzone id="recipe-onstart" auto-upload="false" list-appearance="detailed" accept="*/*" multiple max-file-count="8"></web-dropzone>
          <div style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
            <button type="button" class="pa-btn pa-btn--sm pa-btn--primary" id="recipe-onstart-go">Start upload</button>
          </div>
          <small class="pa-form-text">With <code>auto-upload="false"</code> files sit <code>pending</code> and the strip stays hidden until you kick off the upload.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- POPOVER PLACEMENT -->
